{"3797830": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Egglings", "steam_appid": 3797830, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797830/extras/52d84c5a482978e3507b1fbf91c7a556.avif?t=1761066041\" width=1280 height=360 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About this game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Egglings </strong>is a beautifully hand-crafted pixel-art creature collector. From birds and amphibians to dinosaurs and dragons, each egg holds a surprise waiting to hatch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your collection as you discover and nurture a wide range of unique Egglings. Place your hatched companions - <i>called egglings</i> <i>- </i>in the shelter to earn valuable bonuses, or release them into the wild to unlock new rewards. <strong>Rare golden</strong> variants await the most dedicated collectors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797830/extras/0aa28b41adb92a4c910f830951264e0b.poster.avif?t=1761066041\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797830/extras/0aa28b41adb92a4c910f830951264e0b.webm?t=1761066041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797830/extras/0aa28b41adb92a4c910f830951264e0b.mp4?t=1761066041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short and satisfying</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hatch and collect over 40 unique Egglings</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover rare golden variants with exclusive passive bonuses</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete quests</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decide to sell, release or sheleter you hatched egglings</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797830/extras/051d58967343c63414aa83dddb90d8c7.poster.avif?t=1761066041\" width=250 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797830/extras/051d58967343c63414aa83dddb90d8c7.webm?t=1761066041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Me</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hi, I'm Maurice!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>I currently live in Germany and develop games in my free time.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>I started working on Egglings earlier this year,</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>and it’s my first commercial project.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>As a solo developer, I created and programmed all the assets myself.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>I hope you enjoy Egglings!</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797830/extras/52d84c5a482978e3507b1fbf91c7a556.avif?t=1761066041\" width=1280 height=360 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About this game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Egglings </strong>is a beautifully hand-crafted pixel-art creature collector. From birds and amphibians to dinosaurs and dragons, each egg holds a surprise waiting to hatch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your collection as you discover and nurture a wide range of unique Egglings. Place your hatched companions - <i>c